[Effect.map] for a whole list, as a page's effects become the app's:

```roc
SettingsMsg(page_msg) => {
    (page, effects) = Settings.update(model.page, page_msg)
    (
        { ..model, page },
        Effect.map_all(effects, |m| SettingsMsg(m)),
    )
}
```

Send a message every `ms` milliseconds, for as long as the subscription is
in the list `subscriptions` returns. Leave it out of the list to stop it:

```roc
subscriptions = |model|
    if model.paused {
        []
    } else {
        [Time.every(1000, |now| Tick(now))]
    }
```

